# SHA-256 of the prebuilt frameworks committed under addons/godot-iap/bin/
# and the Android archives committed under addons/godot-iap/android/.
# CI builds the frameworks with Xcode 26.6 (job `apple-frameworks` in ci-godot-iap.yml)
# and uploads them as an artifact; the maintainer commits that artifact.
# `bun run audit:godot-binaries` verifies the committed files against this
# manifest — the release runs it as a deploy gate
# (release-godot.yml validate-ios) and CI re-runs it on main/next pushes and
# PRs to fail earlier. macOS digests pin pre-signing bytes: notarized
# releases re-sign those frameworks before zipping, so shipped macOS bytes
# differ by design.
#
# Regenerate after an intentional rebuild:
#   node scripts/audit-godot-binary-digests.mjs --write
83bde87e9886e3e57462c145163d789b724080cdaf217de9bf20de546648c718  addons/godot-iap/android/GodotIap.debug.aar
992a8aa43fd53a8d2695f4d0791f12028392dacadfa4a59fbf7e1cf14a1d9e1b  addons/godot-iap/android/GodotIap.release.aar
431c8168c7b87f8d3f3cbb3eee566f8ee765d5f6e58b963d867bd476c594ba92  addons/godot-iap/bin/ios/GodotIap.framework/GodotIap
a808138b23dde6447ed98fb6d8da7404bb0dadb23f39fc6609914ff74299851e  addons/godot-iap/bin/ios/SwiftGodotRuntime.framework/SwiftGodotRuntime
8d0c4c16573ecfbcd9695808b4aea1f60b2a7ab9d76ceb0ab8a96f9d4011980d  addons/godot-iap/bin/macos/GodotIap.framework/GodotIap
e52e84b5f8bd8bf37b0712bd34072a55333575da32c63a4fdad96fb08138a849  addons/godot-iap/bin/macos/SwiftGodotRuntime.framework/SwiftGodotRuntime
